flowchart TD
    Home[Home: Show floating dock] --> Save[Save studio settings locally]
    Appearance[Appearance: Show floating dock switch] --> Save
    Gallery[Horizontal gallery: five real dock previews] --> Pick[Click a card or use arrow keys]
    Pick --> Save
    Save --> Sync[Studio changed event refreshes all windows]
    Save --> Queue[Main thread reads latest floating setting]
    Queue --> Visible{Show dock?}
    Visible -->|No| Hide[Hide only the dock window]
    Visible -->|Yes| Exists{Dock exists?}
    Exists -->|No on Mac| Create[Build hidden non-focusable NSPanel]
    Create --> Policy[Keep app activation policy unchanged]
    Policy --> Resize[Resize and place within monitor work area]
    Exists -->|Yes| Resize
    Resize --> Show[Tauri shows panel and resumes WebKit]
    Sync --> Render[Dock renders saved look and animation]
